Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.23,0:00:05.07,opening,,0,0,0,,{\fnTrebuchet MS}\N{\c&Hff8352&}Dive deep into serious learning,{\fn}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.16,0:00:06.96,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.00,0:00:10.20,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.10,0:00:14.80,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Once upon a time, in a certain place...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.86,0:00:18.55,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistoric creatures full of personality!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.58,0:00:21.95,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Tirano, Stego, Ammonite,Trilobite.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.08,0:00:25.99,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}They've been saying "hi" for 500 million years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.00,0:00:30.20,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Prehistory! Everybody Say (Roar!)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.68,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Ancient, Alright! Future, FLY High!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.68,0:00:35.50,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}A herd of mammoths! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.50,0:00:40.30,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Thud thud thud thud! On your marks, get set, go!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.16,0:00:44.00,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.10,0:00:46.05,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}and get excited!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.08,0:00:49.30,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Witness a miracle born from fossils.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.80,0:00:51.75,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Dive deep into serious learning,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.75,0:00:53.53,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Playing for real.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.70,0:00:56.70,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}The universe begins with passion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.30,0:01:00.02,opening,,0,0,0,,{\c&Hff8352&\fnTrebuchet MS}Super happy!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.11,0:01:05.68,titulo do ep,,0,0,0,,{\an3\b1}Serious Mata-Kamen's Trial{\b0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.97,0:01:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.69,0:01:03.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is a warp zone open?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.85,0:01:04.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.90,0:01:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,It wasn't me either!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.27,0:01:09.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Welcome to the world of serious prehistoric creatures!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.64,0:01:13.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.12,0:01:16.17,Default,,0,0,0,,To the Serious Prehistoric Creature Test \Nto test your knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.42,0:01:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,to test your knowledge!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.33,0:01:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.53,0:01:21.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Mata-Kamen!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What a sense of naming...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.20,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.57,0:01:27.27,Default,,0,0,0,,WHAT IS THIS!?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.52,0:01:29.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a prehistoric creature knowledge test!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.19,0:01:32.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't pass, everyone falls in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.37,0:01:33.19,Default,,0,0,0,,everyone falls in!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.57,0:01:34.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:35.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.25,0:01:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,First question!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.98,0:01:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What is the name of this dinosaur?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.60,0:01:41.31,nomeie os dinossauros,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA3E6FF&}Name the dinosaur named by paleontologist Henry Osborn{\c&H83FF8E&}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.99,0:01:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.82,0:01:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,If you run at the displayed speed,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.62,0:01:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,, you get the right to answer!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.55,0:01:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, what's the answer?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.33,0:01:51.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.77,0:01:52.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I answering?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.99,0:01:53.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.63,0:01:56.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, what was the question?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.78,0:02:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,The correct answer is Tyrannosaurus!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.34,0:02:01.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:03.20,Default,,0,0,0,,That was from Episode 1!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.18,0:02:06.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Tetori!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.38,0:02:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,If you get the next one wrong, \Nthe slide goes vertical!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.86,0:02:13.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What's with this death game?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.39,0:02:15.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, next question!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.69,0:02:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this part of the Triceratops called?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:19.22,nomeie os dinossauros,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA3E6FF&} Name the characteristic head feature possessed by ceratopsians such as Triceratops{\c&H83FF8E&}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.53,0:02:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I-It's faster than before!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.98,0:02:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,This is suddenly impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.54,0:02:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No, it's not impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:29.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember all our club activities!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.82,0:02:31.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You can solve this!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.47,0:02:32.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Tetori...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Frill!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.30,0:02:40.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a frill!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.69,0:02:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Now that you're getting into the groove...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.93,0:02:45.35,Default,,0,0,0,,...next question!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.54,0:02:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What term did Matajiro Yokoyama translate into Japanese?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.30,0:02:49.63,nomeie os dinossauros,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA3E6FF&}Answer in two Kanji characters the word that Matajiro Yokoyama translated into Japanese and popularized {\c&H83FF8E&}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.27,0:02:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.24,0:02:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.34,0:02:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,How sad, considering he was always with you in the clubroom!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.65,0:03:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Matajiro Yokoyama!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.53,0:03:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Matajiro!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.44,0:03:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the Father of Paleontology,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.38,0:03:12.14,Default,,0,0,0,,who translated "dinosaur" as *Kyōryū*
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.25,0:03:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and spread it across Japan!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.81,0:03:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry for not answering correctly earlier!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.46,0:03:19.46,nomeie os dinossauros,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA3E6FF&}Following previous examples where extinct reptiles were translated into Japanese as 'Ichthyosaur' (Gyoryū) or 'Plesiosaur' (Kubinagaryū),
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.46,0:03:20.35,nomeie os dinossauros,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA3E6FF&}Matajiro Yokoyama was the first in Japan to translate 'Dinosaur' as 'Kyōryū' (meaning 'fearful lizard'){\c&H83FF8E&}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.30,0:03:21.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Tetori actually answered it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.19,0:03:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, why is a person like that doing this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.17,0:03:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Watching you guys...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.30,0:03:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,...made me want to test your strength!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.96,0:03:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Matajiro-sensei was watching our activities?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.23,0:03:42.63,Default,,0,0,0,,What an absolute honor!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.38,0:03:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He passed out!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.89,0:03:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget about Dino?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.07,0:03:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm at my limit!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.04,0:03:54.44,Default,,0,0,0,,DINO!!!!!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.92,0:03:57.41,Survival Instinct,,0,0,0,,Survival Instinct!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.43,0:03:59.20,Survival Instinct,,0,0,0,,Molting!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.40,0:04:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I am....
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.81,0:04:19.41,Default,,0,0,0,,the King of Dinosaurs
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.81,0:04:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.18,0:04:24.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Molting?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:26.75,Default,,0,0,0,,My kin...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.88,0:04:29.36,Default,,0,0,0,,lay waste to everything!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.59,0:04:37.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Nooo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.19,0:04:40.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Kanna-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.90,0:04:41.86,Default,,0,0,0,, Kanna-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.98,0:04:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.90,0:04:44.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Dino!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.00,0:04:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You were having a nightmare, \Nare you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.10,0:04:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We're back...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.64,0:04:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,, Was it a dream?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.84,0:04:52.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me introduce our new club member!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:55.89,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Matajiro-sensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.10,0:04:57.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you!
